Package: shell-ai
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, bash, curl
Description: A language-agnostic CLI tool that brings AI into your terminal
 shell-ai turns your everyday terminal prompt into an AI-powered workspace.
 Instead of opening a browser or switching windows, you can query AI directly
 in your prompt. Once the response is delivered, full terminal control is
 instantly handed back to you.
